      "content": "Yingkou East Railway Station (IATA: YDD) is a railway station of Beijing–Harbin High-Speed Railway, in particular of both the Panjin–Yingkou and Harbin–Dalian sub-sections. It is located in Dashiqiao, in the Yingkou prefecture level city, in the Liaoning province of China.",
